ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Brutalism
Board: /styles/brutalism
Companions: brutalism-starter.html, brutalism-study.ai, brutalism-study.psd

Artboards
1. A section through a wall, 3000 × 2000 px. Show thickness, not just a facade.
2. Board-marks as a repeating stripe in the concrete, #8d8a84 against #96938c. Uneven on purpose.
3. One heavy word, "RAW", black #1c1b19, no outline, no gradient.
4. A mono stamp: "pour 04 · board mark left visible."
5. A hard offset shadow, 14 px, black. Not a soft blur. The shadow is a second slab.

Rules
No photograph of a known building.
No marble, timber, or curtain wall.
If the making is invisible, it is the wrong style.
Ground around the slab: #d8d2c8.
